  "html": "<article id=\"post-6734\" class=\"container post-6734 page type-page status-publish has-post-thumbnail hentry\">\n\n\t<div class=\"entry-content | container\">\n\t\t<section  class=\"container section--services-hero pt-5 services-hero\">\n\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main\">\n\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row__left\">\n                <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group full-width-mobile is-vertical is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-2c90304e wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group flow center-content-mobile full-width-mobile has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group h-align icon-plus-title is-layout-flex wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">    <div class=\"iconblock wp-elements-1 has-background has-red-background-color has-text-color has-secondary-inverse-color\" data-size=\"md\" data-padding=\"2\" data-display=\"inline\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-info\" /></svg>    </div>\n\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-primary-inverse-color has-text-color has-link-color has-x-large-font-size wp-elements-2\">HVAC, Plumbing &amp; Indoor Air Quality Services in Knightdale, NC&nbsp;</h1>\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Happy Home Services covers heating and cooling, plumbing, and indoor air quality throughout Knightdale and eastern Wake County, quoting every job upfront and answering calls 24/7. Most of Knightdale&#8217;s homes went up in the past two or three decades, and newer construction has its own maintenance logic: equipment fails on a schedule, and staying ahead of that schedule is cheaper than reacting to it.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Builder-grade systems installed during Knightdale&#8217;s growth waves are now crossing the ten-to-fifteen-year mark&nbsp;in neighborhood after&nbsp;neighborhood. Water heaters from those years fail with little&nbsp;warning,&nbsp;first-generation heat pumps lose efficiency before they lose function, and warranties quietly depend on documented maintenance. Our work here centers on keeping those systems efficient and replacing them on the homeowner&#8217;s timeline.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group mb-1 full-width-mobile is-content-justification-left is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-a1b15d37 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div  class=\"wp-block-group mb-3 full-width-mobile schedule-and-call-cta is-content-justification-left is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-a1b15d37 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group schedule-cta-container is-vertical is-content-justification-stretch is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-41171c72 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<a href=\"/bookings\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta se-widget-button\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-event\" /></svg><span >Schedule Now</span>\n\n</a>\n\n    <p class=\"horizon-text has-secondary-font-family wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\">or speak with an expert!</p>\n\n<a href=\"tel:+13362819025\" aria-label=\"Call now: +13362819025\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta phone-link\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-phone\" /></svg><span data-show-on=\"desktop\">(336) 281-9025</span>\n        <span data-show-on=\"mobile\">Call Now</span>\n</a>\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color has-secondary-font-family has-small-font-size text-center wp-elements-3 wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\"><strong>Same Day Appointments Available by Phone</strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div  class=\"badge mb-3\" style='min-height:unset;'>\n    <div class=\"badge__content\">\n        <svg width=\"45\" height=\"45\" viewBox=\"0 0 45 45\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n            <title>Google</title>\n            <path d=\"M42.0046 22.9145C42.0046 21.4661 41.8746 20.0733 41.6332 18.7363H22.395V26.647H33.3882C32.9054 29.191 31.457 31.3451 29.2844 32.7935V37.9373H35.9137C39.7762 34.372 42.0046 29.1353 42.0046 22.9145Z\" fill=\"#4285F4\"/>\n            <path d=\"M22.396 42.8766C27.9112 42.8766 32.535 41.0568 35.9147 37.9371L29.2854 32.7933C27.4655 34.0189 25.1443 34.7617 22.396 34.7617C17.0851 34.7617 12.5727 31.1777 10.9571 26.3496H4.16064V31.6234C7.52175 38.2899 14.4111 42.8766 22.396 42.8766Z\" fill=\"#34A853\"/>\n            <path d=\"M10.9608 26.3308C10.5523 25.1052 10.3109 23.8053 10.3109 22.4498C10.3109 21.0942 10.5523 19.7943 10.9608 18.5687V13.2949H4.16436C2.77164 16.0432 1.97314 19.1444 1.97314 22.4498C1.97314 25.7551 2.77164 28.8563 4.16436 31.6046L9.45671 27.4821L10.9608 26.3308Z\" fill=\"#FBBC05\"/>\n            <path d=\"M22.396 10.155C25.4043 10.155 28.0783 11.1949 30.2138 13.2004L36.0633 7.35097C32.5165 4.04557 27.9112 2.02148 22.396 2.02148C14.4111 2.02148 7.52175 6.60818 4.16064 13.2933L10.9571 18.567C12.5727 13.7389 17.0851 10.155 22.396 10.155Z\" fill=\"#EA4335\"/>\n        </svg>\n        <div class=\"badge__content__rating-container\">\n            <p class=\"h6 badge__content__rating-container__title\">Google Rating</p>\n            <div class=\"badge__content__rating-container__stars\">\n                <div class=\"badge__content__rating-container__stars__number\">\n                    5                </div>\n                <div class=\"badge__content__rating-container__stars__container\">\n                    <div class=\"badge__content__rating-container__stars__container__black\">★★★★★</div>\n                    <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"badge__content__rating-container__stars__container__white\">☆☆☆☆☆</div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n    </div></div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\t\t\t</div><!-- ./left -->\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row__right\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elevated content-fullbleed-mobile box-shadow-lg border-radius-lg\" >\n    <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\t\t\t<figure class=\"wp-block-post-featured-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" src=\"/images/2024/11/NU-HappyHome_Stock-9-scaled.jpg\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"The entrance of Happy Home Heating and Cooling in Durham, NC\" style=\"object-fit:cover;\" srcset=\"/images/2024/11/NU-HappyHome_Stock-9-scaled.jpg 2560w, /images/2024/11/NU-HappyHome_Stock-9-300x200.jpg 300w, /images/2024/11/NU-HappyHome_Stock-9-1024x683.jpg 1024w, /images/2024/11/NU-HappyHome_Stock-9-768x512.jpg 768w, /images/2024/11/NU-HappyHome_Stock-9-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, /images/2024/11/NU-HappyHome_Stock-9-2048x1365.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1010px) 100vw, (max-width: 1440px) 50vw, 768px\" /></figure>\n\t\t\t</div>\n</div>\t\t\t</div><!-- ./right -->\n\t\t</div><!-- ./row -->\n\n</div>\n\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main section--services-hero__main--empty has-background has-secondary-background-color\">\n\t</div><!-- ./row -->\n\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group container flow pb-4 has-secondary-inverse-color has-primary-background-color has-text-color has-background\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60)\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group wrap-mobile flow pb-4 has-primary-inverse-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-4 is-horizontal is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-cdbf0242 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:0;padding-bottom:0\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-db3ccc14 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:0;padding-bottom:0\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Heating and Cooling for Newer Homes&nbsp;</h2>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Gas service reaches&nbsp;most of&nbsp;Knightdale, and heat pumps still carry&nbsp;the majority of&nbsp;homes. Piedmont summers demand months of cooling, which is where builder-grade equipment shows its age first.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"/services/cooling/air-conditioning\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Air Conditioning Services in Knightdale</strong></a>&nbsp;Repair, replacement, and tune-ups on every major brand, with straight talk when a system from the town&#8217;s earlier growth wave reaches the end of economical repair.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"/services/heating/heat-pumps\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Heat Pump Services in Knightdale</strong></a>&nbsp;We install, repair, and&nbsp;maintain&nbsp;the heat pumps that dominate eastern Wake, and&nbsp;pairing&nbsp;one with a&nbsp;<a href=\"/services/heating/smart-thermostats\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">smart thermostat</a>&nbsp;recovers&nbsp;efficiency&nbsp;a builder-grade setup leaves on the table. Our&nbsp;<a href=\"/maintenance\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">maintenance plans</a>&nbsp;document the service history that manufacturer warranties expect.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"/services/cooling/mini-split\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Ductless Mini-Split Systems</strong></a>&nbsp;The bonus room over the garage is the standing complaint in Knightdale floor plans, hot in July and cold in January. A mini-split&nbsp;conditions&nbsp;that room directly and lets the main system stay balanced.&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Indoor Air Quality in Tight Construction&nbsp;</h2>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Newer homes seal well, which conserves energy while trapping humidity and recirculating whatever the filter misses. Knightdale&#8217;s pollen season supplies plenty for it to miss.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"/services/dehumidifiers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Whole-Home Dehumidifiers</strong></a>: Mechanical humidity control keeps a tight house comfortable in August without overcooling it.&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"/services/indoor-air-quality/air-ducts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Air Duct Cleaning and Sealing</strong></a>: Builder-installed ductwork commonly leaks at the joints. Sealing recovers the lost&nbsp;efficiency&nbsp;and cleaning removes the dust already inside.&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"/services/indoor-air-quality/air-purifiers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Air Filtration and Purification</strong></a>: Upgraded filtration captures the pollen and fine particles a standard builder filter passes through.&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Plumbing Ahead of the Failure Curve&nbsp;</h2>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Knightdale homes receive water through Raleigh Water&#8217;s system, treated from Falls Lake and&nbsp;relatively soft&nbsp;at the tap, so softeners rarely apply here. The plumbing risk in a newer town is timing: fixtures and water heaters installed together at construction age out together.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"/services/plumbing/water-heater-installation-replacements\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Water Heater Installation and Replacement</strong></a>&nbsp;Units set when a subdivision was built are now past warranty across much of town, and they rarely announce their failure. We replace tank and tankless units on your schedule and handle&nbsp;<a href=\"/services/plumbing/water-heater-repairs-maintenance\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">repairs and maintenance</a>&nbsp;for units with life remaining.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"/services/plumbing/kitchen-bathroom\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Kitchen and Bathroom Plumbing</strong></a>&nbsp;Builder-grade faucets, disposals, and toilets wear out faster than the house around them. We repair and upgrade them with the price set first.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"/services/plumbing/frozen-burst-pipe-repair\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Frozen and Burst Pipe Repair</strong></a>&nbsp;Even newer homes carry vulnerable runs through garages and attics, and a Triangle freeze finds them. We respond fast and repair the break properly.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Homeowners who want&nbsp;better-tasting&nbsp;water can add&nbsp;<a href=\"/services/plumbing/water-treatment-filtration\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">filtration</a>&nbsp;at the kitchen tap or for the whole house.&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Staying Ahead&nbsp;With&nbsp;Knightdale Homeowners&nbsp;</h2>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Annual tune-ups protect efficiency and warranty coverage, and planned replacements beat emergency ones on price and stress alike. Every job starts with a written&nbsp;quote,&nbsp;our trained technicians keep pace with the equipment going into new Wake County homes, and honest, upfront pricing with a 100% money-back guarantee backs the work. Call or book online to schedule.&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n\n<div  class=\"accordion\" style=\"--_accordion-separator-color: #076395\">\n            <details class=\"accordion-item\" data-custom-open=\"true\" open>\n            <summary class=\"accordion-title | paired-icon-text\">\n                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--closed | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevrondown\" /></svg>                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--open | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronup\" /></svg>                <p class=\"paired-text\">Do you offer around-the-clock service in Knightdale? </p>\n            </summary>\n\n            <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n                <div class=\"accordion-content-inner\">\n                    <p>Yes. Calls are answered 24/7 across Knightdale and eastern Wake County, and active failures dispatch on priority regardless of the hour.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </details>            <details class=\"accordion-item\">\n            <summary class=\"accordion-title | paired-icon-text\">\n                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--closed | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevrondown\" /></svg>                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--open | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronup\" /></svg>                <p class=\"paired-text\">My house is only a few years old. Does the HVAC really need annual maintenance? </p>\n            </summary>\n\n            <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n                <div class=\"accordion-content-inner\">\n                    <p>Yes, and arguably more than an older home&#8217;s does. Annual tune-ups preserve efficiency, document the service history manufacturer warranties require, and catch the small faults that turn into July breakdowns.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </details>            <details class=\"accordion-item\">\n            <summary class=\"accordion-title | paired-icon-text\">\n                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--closed | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevrondown\" /></svg>                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--open | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronup\" /></svg>                <p class=\"paired-text\">Should I replace my water heater before it fails? </p>\n            </summary>\n\n            <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n                <div class=\"accordion-content-inner\">\n                    <p>If it was installed when your neighborhood was built, it is likely past warranty, and tank failures tend to arrive as leaks rather than warnings. Replacing on your own schedule costs less than replacing after a failure floods the garage or closet.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </details>            <details class=\"accordion-item\">\n            <summary class=\"accordion-title | paired-icon-text\">\n                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--closed | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevrondown\" /></svg>                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--open | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronup\" /></svg>                <p class=\"paired-text\">Does Knightdale&#8217;s water need softening? </p>\n            </summary>\n\n            <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n                <div class=\"accordion-content-inner\">\n                    <p>The Falls Lake supply through Raleigh Water arrives treated and relatively soft, so taste-focused filtration is the upgrade homeowners actually notice.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </details>            <details class=\"accordion-item\">\n            <summary class=\"accordion-title | paired-icon-text\">\n                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--closed | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevrondown\" /></svg>                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--open | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronup\" /></svg>                <p class=\"paired-text\">What parts of the Triangle near Knightdale do you serve? </p>\n            </summary>\n\n            <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n                <div class=\"accordion-content-inner\">\n                    <p>Raleigh, Cary, and Durham are all inside our coverage. The Service Areas menu carries the complete list of towns.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </details>    </div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group container flow py-5\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Powered by NearU — We’re here to make your HVAC Service experience the best one yet!</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"430\" height=\"98\" src=\"/images/2024/02/NearU.png\" alt=\"NearU\" class=\"wp-image-36\" style=\"width:220px\" srcset=\"/images/2024/02/NearU.png 430w, /images/2024/02/NearU-300x68.png 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 430px) 100vw, 430px\" /></figure>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">NearU is setting up a new standard of HVAC, plumbing, drains, IAQ, and generator services with major improvements to reliability, convenience, and customer care. We equip our companies with better resources, training, and tools, so they can provide you with the best possible service outcome. If you’ve recently learned that your go-to HVAC, plumbing, drains, IAQ, and generator company has joined NearU, then this is something to get excited about! We protect the people and culture that make each company great, while ensuring their customers consistently receive the best possible care.</p>\n</div>\n\t</div>\n\t</article><!-- #post-6734 -->"
}